# Rust build output
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Archive manifests: a listing of a private photo library, in a public repo.
# Generated on demand by scripts/archive-inventory.ps1 and never committed --
# see docs/INVENTORY.md. Do not "helpfully" add them back.
/inventory/

# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored.
# This crate is a binary, and Rust convention is to commit the lockfile for
# binaries so builds are reproducible. (The "ignore Cargo.lock" advice applies
# to libraries.)
